// Corpus for progress-self-monitoring/lib/commitments.js - scan().
// A forward commitment in the agent's OWN final message: first person, a
// deferred act, a "when" that is later in this session. The one list the
// agent cannot re-read is what it said it would do; the sweep hands it back.
// Misses: the past, the present, other people's futures, conditional offers
// (handoff's), and deferral out of the delivery (coverage's).
